Alembic migrations for Mediary.

Target database: PostgreSQL (Naver Cloud DB for PostgreSQL, asyncpg in app code).
Apply with:

```bash
alembic -c database/migrations/alembic.ini upgrade head
```

Local/tests may use SQLite via SQLAlchemy ``create_all`` without running Alembic.

Session status mapping for calendar (K-01) lives in ``database/session_status.py``.
